<title>USA: Amgen board approves stock buy plan.</title>
<headline>Amgen board approves stock buy plan.</headline>
<dateline>THOUSAND OAKS, Calif 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amgen Inc on Thursday announced its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $450 million of Amgen stock during 1997.</p>
<p>The move was disclosed in the biotechnology company's fourth quarter report without an explanation for the board's action.</p>
<p>Amgen shares on Thursday closed at 55, down 1/2. The stock's 52-week range stands at 51-3/8 to 66-1/2.</p>
</text>
